# Desktop pack versioning

Before `npm run pack` or any `pack:win` / `pack:mac` / `pack:linux` ship, run `npm run bump-version` first. Do not pack with the same `version` / `versionCode` as the last pack.

- `versionCode` goes up by one.
- `version` is always `{floor(code / 10)}.{code % 10}.0`.
- After the bump, set `VERSIONING.md` current numbers to match `package.json`.
- Installers under `build/` stay gitignored.
